clauses.body:
All notices, requests, demands, and other communications required or permitted under this Agreement shall be in writing and shall be deemed duly given when (a) delivered personally, (b) sent by certified or registered mail, return receipt requested, postage prepaid, (c) sent by overnight courier service, or (d) sent by email with confirmation of receipt, to the parties at the following addresses:

If to Label: {{NOTICE_ADDRESS_LABEL}}
If to Artist: {{NOTICE_ADDRESS_ARTIST}}

Either party may change its address for notice by giving written notice to the other party in accordance with this Section.
